sub> context<sub>,</sub> and advanta<sub>g</sub>es over matrix-based in<sub>p</sub>uts. Index Terms—Encrypted trafic classification, out-of-distribution <sub>g</sub>eneralization<sub>,</sub> <sub>p</sub>re-trainin<sub>g,</sub> multi-flow re<sub>p</sub>resentation.},
